    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to bring to the market this 4 bedroom, 2 bathroom detached residence, ideally located in the village of Tournafulla.\n\nThis property is conveniently positioned just 12km from the market town of Abbeyfeale and 13km from the county town Newcastle West, with Limerick City and Tralee both approximately 4550 minutes away, the property offers easy access to employment, shopping, education and leisure amenities across Limerick and Kerry.\n\nTournafulla National School and The Hub, incorporating a community shop and café in addition to a community centre and GAA club, are within walking distance, offering a strong sense of community and village living.\n\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, the renowned Limerick Greenway is also easily accessible from nearby Newcastle West, Barnagh and Abbeyfeale offering a scenic off-road route for walking and cycling. \n\nThe energy efficient home enjoys a B rating with heating via Oil and solid fuel and double glazed windows fitted throughout. The property has a tarmacadam driveway, steeltech shed and mature lawns and hedging.\n\nAn appealing home in a well-connected and welcoming village setting, ideal for families, first-time buyers or those seeking a more relaxed pace of life.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.16m x 1.80m\nwith tile flooring\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.82m x 3.46m\nwith solid fuel stove, wooden flooring & bay window\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 7.82m x 3.63m\nfitted kitchen with gas hob, solid fuel stove, wall & floor tiles, french doors to rear & window\n\nUtility Room - 2.36m x 1.77m\nplumbed for washing machine and dryer, fitted units, floor tiles, half glazed door to rear\n\nBedroom Corridor - 8.86m x 1.16m\nfloor tiles, 2 velux windows and access to attic\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.46m x 2.92m\ndouble with fitted units, wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nEnsuite - 2.05m x 1.15m\nTriton pumped shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.27m x 2.87m\ndouble with wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.94m x 2.87m\ndouble with wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.86m x 2.67m\nsingle with wooden laminate flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.92m x 1.88m\nTriton pumped shower, bath, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nOutbuilding - \n\n\nSteeltech Shed - 4m x 2.5m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 2 bathroom detached residence in an convenient village location</li><li>Centrally located - 12km from the market town of Abbeyfeale and 13km to Newcastle West</li><li>Limerick City and Tralee are both within 45-50 mins respectively</li><li>Walking distance to all local amenities inc. Primary School, Community Hub, GAA club and community centre </li><li>The Limerick Greenway is easily accessible from nearby Newcastle West, Barnagh and Abbeyfeale</li><li>The N21 Adare Bypass is currently under construction and will improve access towards Limerick City on completion</li><li>Combined with the availability of modern broadband services, Tournafulla is an increasingly attractive location for commuters, hybrid works and those seeking a better balance between rural living and connectivity</li><li>Energy efficient home - B Energy Rating</li><li>OFCH & Solid Fuel Stove</li><li>Tarmacadam Driveway </li><li>Mature lawns and hedging</li><li>Steeltech Shed 4m x 2.5m</ul>"
      },
